$ a@plain-a devlab frobnicate
2> devlab: unknown command frobnicate; devlab help
? 2
$ a@plain-a devlab run
2> devlab: devlab run [opts] -- <cmd...>
? 2
$ a@plain-a devlab run --phone
2> devlab: devlab run [opts] -- <cmd...>
? 2
$ a@plain-a devlab acquire --devices two
2> devlab: --devices takes a whole number
? 2
$ a@plain-a devlab acquire --no-device
2> devlab: no devlab.json in <sandbox>/wt/plain-a: nothing to lease without a device
? 2
$ a@plain-a devlab exec
2> devlab: devlab exec -- <cmd...>
? 2
$ a@plain-a devlab env
2> devlab: no lease for <sandbox>/wt/plain-a (claude:<a>): run devlab acquire
? 4
$ a@plain-a devlab exec -- true
2> devlab: no lease for <sandbox>/wt/plain-a (claude:<a>): run devlab acquire
? 4
$ a@plain-a devlab stack up
2> devlab: no lease for <sandbox>/wt/plain-a (claude:<a>): run devlab acquire
? 4
$ a@plain-a devlab release
2> devlab: nothing held here
